ion>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Corrupted Wanwood</b> is a tree exclusive to the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a>. It is found all around the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>. Big Bomb Fruit grow on the branches of this tree, which will fall and explode once the tree is cut down. Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Acacia\" title=\"Corrupt Acacia\">Corrupt Acacia</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_Cactus\" title=\"Corrupted Cactus\">Corrupted Cactus</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Deadwood\" title=\"Corrupt Deadwood\">Corrupt Deadwood</a>, Corrupted Wanwood cannot be made by bringing a regular <a href=\"/wiki/Wanwood\" title=\"Wanwood\">Wanwood</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> and having a mysterious mushroom hit it. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830030853\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019490/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.638      1 Template:Wood\n100.00%   27.638      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4685-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260830030853 and revision id 20477. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tree"],"links":[{"title":"2025 Halloween Event","exists":true